    "type": "Underwriting",
    "icon": "ti-clipboard-check",
    "color": "#BA7517",
    "description": "Price the scope and protect the margin. One case per job: enter the contract price and the costs, and the margin, headroom and break-even price fall out of it.",
    "fields": [
